On Friday 09 May 2008, karl wrote:
>  I have switched off that the whole script written in the RKward window
> is shown in the console when I run the script.

ok, well, no scripts and no script output will be shown in the console, then. 
You should still see the result in the command log (unless you've switched 
that off as well).

To direct something to the output window, instead, use:
	rk.print (x[1])

Regards
Thomas
